   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_core_Result_d51722.html\">Result</a>&lt; <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_core_Bitset_9afc89.html#SWS_CORE_01716\">Bitset</a>&lt; <a href=\"#class-decl\">N</a> &gt; &amp; &gt; set (<a class=\"cppref\" href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/types/size_t\" title=\"cppreference.com (C++17)\">std::size_t</a> pos, bool val=true) noexcept;</pre>",
